{"id":"logement","lemma":"logement","pos":"noun","rank":4257,"glosses":["housing, dwelling","home, abode","residence, domicile"],"ipa":"/lɔʒ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f7/Fr-logement.ogg/Fr-logement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"logements"},"formAudio":{"logements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-logements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis à la recherche d'un logement.","en":"I'm looking for a place to stay.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"research"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a la"]]},{"text":"Il n'y a pas assez de logements étudiants.","en":"There's not enough student housing.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"studying","l":"étudiant"}]},{"text":"Je veux que vous preniez votre propre logement.","en":"I want you to get your own place.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"own"},null]},{"text":"La situation du logement ne montre aucun espoir d'amélioration.","en":"The housing situation shows no hope of improvement.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"watch, wristwatch"},{"g":"none, no-one"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"improvement"}]},{"text":"Ce logement est plus grand que tous les autres dans l'immeuble.","en":"This apartment is bigger than any other one in the building.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"big"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"other","l":"autre"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"building"}]}]}